  "body": "Is there any or will there be any way to know how many WebHID apps have a device open?  Apps are not very good at cooperating. With a microphone device, there is an issue that we have experienced in our product.  The mic is opened and \"sync'd\" to our conferencing application for mute/unmute.  The user mutes the device but goes to another app, say a softphone like Skype, and that app unmutes it (unbeknownst to the user this also unmutes our app).  User talks on phone:  \"I'm in the middle of this stupid conference\".  Bad.  Not sure anything can be done to fully solve this  type of issue except tell the user to be careful but perhaps there is a way for use to tell whether another app has also opened this device?  Thanks for any thoughts.",
